        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of brocaded silk shoes. Bound with pink silk ribbon. The flaps are faced back with black satin brocaded in pink and green. The shoes are lined with white leather. They have a rounded point toe, a concave heel set well forward and straps for buckles."@en , "Pair of brocaded silk shoes, England, 1760s"@en ;
